# Crabomination's "Emerge from artifact {5}{B}{B}" chooses the artifact to sacrifice as its total cost is determined, before
# the mana is paid: the total comes down by that artifact's mana value (CR 702.119a, 601.2f). Bot1 chooses Lotus Petal,
# then pays with two Black Lotuses and the Petal itself, sacrificing it for {B}: the artifact chosen is gone, so the emerge
# sacrifice can't be paid with it (CR 118.3, 400.7, 601.2h), and the cast is taken back (CR 733.1) rather than made
# without one - Crabomination is back in hand, the Lotuses and the Petal on the battlefield, the pool empty. Then Bot1
# chooses the Petal again and pays with the two Lotuses and the Swamp: the Petal is sacrificed and Crabomination resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Lotus Petal
Crabomination
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x40

[Actions]
